  "content": {
    "type": "mcq",
    "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">A cluster fly is traveling at a velocity of <math alttext=\"76\"><mn>76</mn>\n</math> centimeters per second. What is this velocity, in <strong>millimeters</strong> per second?&nbsp;<math alttext=\"left parenthesis 1 centimeter  equals 10 millimeters right parenthesis\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>centimeter</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>millimeters</mtext></mrow></mfenced></math></p>",
